[0.030, "o", "      --post                           Publish inline comments + a summary to the PR (requires a token)\r\n      --pr string                      Review a GitHub PR: https://github.com/owner/repo/pull/N or owner/repo#N (no GitHub PAT needed for public repos in dry-run)\r\n      --suggest                        Emit GitHub native one-click suggestions for proven single-line replacements; author-applied, never pushed. Requires --post (inert in dry-run) (default OFF; else a plain hint)\r\n"]
